msgctxt "doeAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Show a Pareto plot of the standardized effects. For a saturated model (no "
"error degrees of freedom) of two-level factorial terms, the plot shows the "
"absolute effects with the margin of error based on Lenth's (1989) pseudo "
"standard error; other saturated models give an error."
